  "description": "Looking for a breakfast restaurants in Las Vegas, NV? Come on over! Nothing beats the early morning smell of sizzling bacon, fresh coffee, and fluffy pancakes drizzled with real maple syrup. Keep it classic with brunch staples like Eggs Benedict, Omelets and Belgian Waffles, or go South of the Border with Mexican favorites like Machaca, Chilaquiles and delicious Baja Breakfast Tacos. Beat the heat with a tall cool glass of OJ, a refreshing Ice Cold Mimosa, or check out our exclusive Vegas Drink Menu. Stop in for lunch too! With everything from crisp fresh salads to hearty sandwiches and big juicy burgers made with a half-pound of fresh Angus beef, The Broken Yolk Cafe has got you covered! When it comes to lunch, brunch and breakfast in Las Vegas, you can't beat The Broken Yolk Café.",
